# Keep host-built artefacts out of the Docker build context.
#
# The web Dockerfile's `builder` stage runs `COPY . .`. Without this file the
# host's node_modules/ and .next/ are copied into the Linux image, clobbering
# the clean `npm install` from the `deps` stage. On macOS that pulls in the
# platform-specific @next/swc-darwin-* native binary, which cannot run inside
# node:20-slim and fails the build with:
#   "Mismatching @next/swc version" / "missing field `hashSalt`".
node_modules
.next
.swc

# Local env, tooling and caches that must never enter the image.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
npm-debug.log*

# Tests / dev-only assets are not needed to build or run the app.
__tests__
coverage
